# Taskboard CLI

A dependency-free task manager for Bun. Data is stored in `.taskboard.json` in
the current directory, or at the path supplied by `TASKBOARD_FILE`.

```sh
bun run src/cli.ts add --title "Ship release" --tags work,urgent --due 2026-09-10
bun run src/cli.ts list --status open --tag urgent
bun run src/cli.ts done 1
bun run src/cli.ts stats
bun run src/cli.ts delete 1
```

Each command prints one JSON value to standard output. Errors are written to
standard error and return a non-zero exit code. `list --overdue YYYY-MM-DD`
returns open tasks due strictly before that date.
