A dependency-free task manager for Bun. Data is stored in `.taskboard.json` in
the current directory, or at the path supplied by `TASKBOARD_FILE`.

```sh
bun run src/cli.ts add --title "Ship release" --tags work,urgent --due 2026-09-10
